{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "34e2fdb1-cf2c-8a6b-9d75-9c55c8556bba",
  "created_at": "2026-02-08T08:59:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:53:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:53:58-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, good morning. I know it's Sunday and City Hall is shut tight, so I figured the storm line was my best shot. Is this the right number for plowing questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It sure is. We keep this line open on weekends when there's weather. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:54:21-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's not much of a storm, I'll admit. We got a dusting overnight, and it's bitter cold, so it's all sitting there frozen. But I'm on a dead-end street, and I have a theory that we get plowed last. Possibly after the plow driver has retired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:54:43-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha. Yeah, I hear that one a lot. Dead ends do tend to come at the end of the route. The drivers do the main roads first, then the side streets, and the dead ends get done last."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "See, I knew it. Not that I take it personally. Okay, I take it a little personally."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:55:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I get it. Can I get your name and the street you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:55:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Erin Quinn. And, um, I'd rather not say the street over the phone if that's all right. I just want to know generally when it might get cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:55:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Well, without the street I can't tell you where you are on the route. Is it a dusting you're dealing with, or is there a plowable amount?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:55:43-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A dusting, like I said. An inch, maybe less. But the cold makes it all crunchy and slick, and my car's been sitting, and I've got to get out later today. I was just sitting here with my coffee, reading the newspaper, the obituaries section, out of habit, you know how it goes, and I thought, I'll call and ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:56:10-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Well, honestly, with an inch or less the crews may not do a full plow on the side streets at all. They may just treat the main roads and the hills with salt and sand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:56:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that means maybe never for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:56:31-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could mean that, yeah. If it's under that plowing trigger, the side streets mostly wait for the sun and the salt to do the work. If we get more snow later this week, the dead ends would be in that round."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:56:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So when would it be cleared, if you had to say? Today? Tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:56:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a dusting, I'd say don't count on a plow today. The sun should help by the afternoon if you have any exposure. Is it more ice than snow where you are?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:57:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's ice under snow. Very festive. Very Newport in February."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:57:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. If it's really slick, I can pass it along as an icy-street report and they can see about sanding. That's different from plowing. I'd need the street for that, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh. Fine. You've worn me down. Is it all right if I just give you the callback number and you tell me whether it's on the list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:57:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can do that, but the crew will need the location to do anything. The number just lets them reach you. What's the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:57:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0177."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0177, got it. And the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:58:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, you win. It's a little dead end off the main road, and I'll just say it's the last street before the water. You'll figure it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I need the actual street name, hon, or I'm just writing a poem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:58:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair. Fair enough. Honestly, I think I just wanted somebody to confirm that we're last. You've done that. Consider me informed and mildly insulted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:58:33-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can't plow a dusting everywhere, but I'll put a note on the sheet that a caller on a dead end reported ice, with your number. If you do want sand, call back with the street and I'll flag it right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'll think about it. Thanks, Denise. Stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T08:58:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Erin. Take it slow on those steps."
    }
  ],
